[00:00.00] 作词 : Morgan Wallen/Ernest Keith Smith/Ryan Vojtesak/Michael Hardy
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/Ernest Keith Smith/Ryan Vojtesak/Michael Hardy
[00:13.42]I'm sittin' on a rerun couch
[00:13.42]我坐在翻新的旧沙发上  
[00:16.74]Lookin' 'round at an empty house
[00:16.74]环顾这间空荡荡的房子  
[00:19.84]Hungover, tryin' to figure out
[00:19.84]宿醉着，试图搞清楚  
[00:22.33]Just how the hell that I got here
[00:22.33]到底怎么会混成现在这样  
[00:26.23]Can't blame it on Colorado
[00:26.23]不能怪到科罗拉多  
[00:29.33]Tanqueray, no reposado
[00:29.33]也怪不了杜松子酒和龙舌兰  
[00:32.53]I could try but I know that I sure
[00:32.53]虽然我可以试着推脱  
[00:35.66]Can't blame it on ice cold beer
[00:35.66]但我知道绝对不是冰啤酒的错  
[00:38.88]There's an empty Jack bottle by the coffee cup
[00:38.88]咖啡杯旁边躺着空的威士忌瓶  
[00:42.01]Did a lot more hurt than good
[00:42.01]带来的伤比好处多得多  
[00:45.18]Girl, I know that I can't fill it back up
[00:45.18]女孩 我知道就算再灌满它  
[00:48.52]But if I could
[00:48.52]你也不会回来  
[00:51.42]You'd be backin' in the driveway
[00:51.42]你不会倒车进车道  
[00:53.92]You'd be un-saying "I'm leaving"
[00:53.92]也不会再说一遍“我要走了”  
[00:57.81]I'd be pullin' my fist from the drywall
[00:57.81]我不会把拳头砸进墙里  
[01:00.63]Watchin' my bloody knuckles start healing
[01:00.63]也不会眼睁睁看着血淋淋的指关节慢慢结痂 
[01:03.97]I wouldn't have a worst enemy
[01:03.97]我也不会变成自己最大的敌人  
[01:06.58]I'd be un-slammin' that bedroom door
[01:06.58]卧室的门不会再被我摔上  
[01:10.38]It'd be a better version of me
[01:10.38]那个看起来更好一点的我  
[01:12.84]Like I used to be
[01:12.84]或许还能回来  
[01:14.43]Like I was before
[01:14.43]像以前那样  
[01:16.22]Your bags are packed and your keys were in your purse
[01:16.22]在你行李打包钥匙揣进包前  
[01:22.45]If I could drink whiskey in reverse
[01:22.45]如果我能把威士忌倒过来喝  
[01:32.42]If I could keep turnin' back time
[01:32.42]如果我能一遍遍把时间往回拨  
[01:35.66]To my seventeen-self
[01:35.66]回到十七岁的自己  
[01:38.69]And tell me the first pull of that stuff
[01:38.69]告诉那个毛头小子第一口酒  
[01:41.28]Will lead you to leavin'
[01:41.28]就可能把你喝到离开  
[01:43.05]I would've drank anything else
[01:43.05]我当初一定会选别的  
[01:45.57]Oh, but that ain't the case
[01:45.57]可惜，人生不是这样  
[01:48.10]I took it down like a wild-eyed country boy would
[01:48.10]我像个乡下毛孩子一样往下灌  
[01:51.92]Girl, and I know I can't fill it back up
[01:51.92]而现在我知道就算再灌满  
